ad private histograms plus computed disjoint scatter offsets inside one OpenMP parallel region.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"f657d30eab5b4bdf\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"fb1b5e9205f4ae86e9ffe0fa32bd9edf5f636752\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.017454082146286964, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/quicksort.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Add a guarded ARM64 NEON implementation of is_sorted that performs overlapping four-int signed comparisons and OR-reduces violation masks.\", \"Keep a scalar, compiler-vectorizable tail loop for all remaining elements and non-ARM targets.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"0af660ffc8ff4cad\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"174ea1398df4c0f90e7fe18acdeaf3cb675b86d3\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.017645341033736866, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/quicksort.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace the normal sorting path with a stable 11/11/10-bit buffered radix pipeline using non-aliasing source and destination buffers.\", \"Express sortedness checking as a dependency-free OR reduction and mark only that read-only loop as safe for GCC vectorization.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"b3bebcd036924af2\", \"role\": \"C\", \"commit\": \"bd8d5961e466ef08b7d171fab71202d0bb63a784\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.017804807052016258, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/quicksort.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace the 16-bit histogram/scatter implementation with a four-pass 8-bit signed radix sort.\", \"Retain one OpenMP team across all passes, with deterministic static contiguous work ranges and a single-thread prefix reduction per pass.\", \"Use size_t for histogram counts and output offsets to avoid index-width overflow.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"f270614ead87450a\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"f2e626e6aaef50d1fdb48c27d1cc9670ad84fcab\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.020272692665457726, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/quicksort.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Replace recursive randomized quicksort with four stable blocked 8-bit radix passes, staging 16 integers per bucket before contiguous output writes.\"]}}]}, \"target_as_data\":